  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Pest Management (IPM) trainings Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The five workshops on Integrated Pest Management (IPM) for public and private stakeholders will contribute to sustainable agricultural development in Sri Lanka by reducing the use of pesticides.After the workshop:&#x2022;	Public and private stakeholders have gained knowledge and awareness of IPM and newly developed IPM techniques;&#x2022;	Public and private stakeholders have learned how to implement the newly developed IPM techniques (practical application).&#x2022;	The IPM workshop will also contribute to popularizing IPM among Sri Lankan farmers and public actors and contribute to improved market entrance for Dutch technologies, services and IPM product suppliers.</narrative>
  </description>
